#################################
##	Sample of Behavior file

Behavior

PyrRotate		0 360 0
StartJitter		8 0 8

FadeInLength		50
FadeOutLength		100

Scale			8.0  20  8.0		### Y= Height of Cylinder from center
ScaleRate		1.1 1.5 1.1
 EndScale		12 20 12 		

SplatFlags			ADDITIVE ROUNDTEXTURE
SplatSetBack		0.5     #0 -> 1.0 splatSetBack = what percent of the splat should be behind the node, and what in front

SplatFalloffType	BOTH			# UP DOWN NONE BOTH	
SplatFadeCenter		0.5				# only for UP and DOWN falloff
	
Alpha			200

StartColor		190 204 255

ByTime1			11  
BeColor1		255 176 19

ByTime2			25
BeColor2		200 108 10

ByTime3			35  
BeColor3		70 70 70

ByTime4			40  
BeColor4		190 204 255

End


